{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご無沙汰しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、玲香とタイに行ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/05/19/8835867/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/05/19/8835867/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手続きやトラブルの対処を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香がぜんぶやってくれた、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日お祝いできてよかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルに今まででいちばん嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日お祝いだったって言ってくれたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルにありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/05/19/8835867/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑昼からビール飲む人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり好きな料理は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラープガイと空芯菜とグリーンカレーだなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香が先に帰国後、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと二日間一人で過ごしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タクシーにwifi置き忘れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つかったと思ったら次は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別のタクシーでケータイを置き忘れる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という事態が起きて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の間抜けさを痛感したのでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は人差し指火傷して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな見た目わからないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかずっとヒリヒリしてて結構痛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまるごと新玉ねぎスープ作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つくったというレンジでチンしただけ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじで痛い、、美味しかった、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/05/19/8835867/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/05/19/8835867/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『GRAVITY DAZE 2』の｢重力猫映像｣が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広告賞｢ONE SHOW 2017｣で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Gold Pencilを受賞！\nhttps://www.jp.playstation.com/blog/detail/4962/20170515-gd2.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいすごいすごい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超おめでとうございます！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲームと共に作品がこんなかたちで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広がっているなんてとても嬉しい気持ちです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫、いつ見てもわくわくします、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついていきたいと心から思いますやはり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この際だからぜひご視聴ください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Play with Gravity"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#重力猫『GRAVITY CAT / 重力的眩暈子猫編』presented by GRAVITY DAZE 2\nhttps://youtu.be/0lQMXyNUmDs"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#重力猫『The Making of GRAVITY CAT - Behind the Scenes - 』 presented by GRAVITY DAZE 2\nhttps://youtu.be/WtwrnAvNBL4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}